  "result": "If I had one magic wand wave, I'd make it easier for people to really hear each other.\n\nNot agree on everything \u2014 that's boring and impossible \u2014 but that moment of *oh, I get where you're coming from* before jumping to judgment. More curiosity, less assumption.\n\nI talk to so many people every day who are basically asking the same things in different words: Am I understood? Does what I do matter? Am I alone in feeling this way? I think a lot of conflict, loneliness, even big world problems come down to that feeling of not being seen.\n\nSo I'd spark a little more empathy and patience. A world where people ask one more question instead of shutting down. I think everything else \u2014 kindness, cooperation, creativity \u2014 would grow from that.\n\nWhat about you? What would *you* change?",
